    "pinout": "                     Arduino UNO\n\n              +-----------------------------------+\n\n              OLED Display (I2C)\n\n              GND ●────────────── OLED GND\n\n              5V  ●────────────── OLED VCC\n\n              A4  ●────────────── OLED SDA\n\n              A5  ●────────────── OLED SCL\n\n\n              DHT11 Sensor\n\n              5V  ●────────────── VCC\n\n              GND ●────────────── GND\n\n              Pin2 ●───────────── DATA\n\n\n              Soil Moisture Sensor\n\n              5V  ●────────────── VCC\n\n              GND ●────────────── GND\n\n              A0  ●────────────── AOUT\n\n\n              Push Button\n\n              Pin4 ●───────────── Button Leg 1\n\n              GND  ●───────────── Button Leg 2\n\n              +-----------------------------------+",
