    "pinout": "                      Arduino UNO\n\n              +--------------------------------+\n\n              5V  ●────────────── VCC (Soil Sensor)\n\n              GND ●────────────── GND (Soil Sensor)\n\n              A0  ●────────────── AOUT (Soil Sensor)\n\n\n              5V  ●────────────── Relay VCC\n\n              GND ●────────────── Relay GND\n\n              Pin7 ●───────────── Relay IN\n\n\n              Relay COM ─────────── 5V\n\n              Relay NO ──────────── Pump (+)\n\n              Pump (-) ──────────── GND\n\n\n              Pin9 ●──────────────┐\n                                  │\n                             [330Ω]\n                                  │\n                             Red LED (+)\n                                  │\n                             Red LED (-)\n                                  │\n              GND ●───────────────┘\n\n\n              Pin8 ●──────────── (+) Buzzer\n                                 │\n              GND ●────────────── (-) Buzzer\n\n              +--------------------------------+",
